  finishOptional: 0
  displayNameTurkish: "Bah\xE7e pergolas\u0131"
  descriptionTurkish: "Teras\u0131n yan\u0131nda serbest duran 3 \xD7 3 m pergola:
    beton ayaklar, \u015Fak\xFCl\xFCnde d\xF6rt direk, iki kiri\u015F, be\u015F a\u015F\u0131k."
  tipsTurkish:
  - "D\u0131\u015Far\u0131da, teras\u0131n sa\u011F\u0131nda. K\xF6\u015Fe kaz\u0131\u011F\u0131nda
    alan\u0131 i\u015Faretle, sonra d\xF6rt ayak yerini kaz ve \xE7ak\u0131l d\xF6k."
  - "Direkleri sehpalarda 2200 mm kes. Direk hi\xE7bir zaman tam dik oturmaz: su
    terazisini iki kom\u015Fu y\xFCze tut, tekerlekle d\xFCzelt, sonra ge\xE7ici
    destek \xE7ak (sol t\u0131k)."
  - "Sadece destekli direk sabitlenebilir ve kiri\u015F ta\u015F\u0131r. Kiri\u015Fler
    ve a\u015F\u0131klar uzanamayaca\u011F\u0131n y\xFCkseklikte: merdiveni oraya
    ta\u015F\u0131, Space ile \xE7\u0131k."
  - "M\xFC\u015Fteri malzeme i\xE7in yar\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 avans olarak \xF6dedi;
    kalan\u0131 teslimde gelir."
